  "readme": "## README.md\n# GDELT Saudi Arabia Daily News Events\n\nEnriched [GDELT 2.0](https://www.gdeltproject.org/) event records related to Saudi Arabia, updated daily. Each record is deduplicated, geo-enriched with nearest-city matching, and includes scraped article full text when available.\n\n**Demo:** [geonews.tabaqat.dev](https://geonews.tabaqat.dev/) - Interactive map to explore the data.\n\n## Bucket Structure\n\n```\ns3://us-west-2.opendata.source.coop/tabaqat/gdelt-sa/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 country=SA/\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 year=YYYY/\n        \u251c\u2500\u2500 YYYY_MM_DD.parquet\n        \u251c\u2500\u2500 YYYY_MM_DD.parquet\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500 ...\n```\n\nOne Parquet file per day (ZSTD compressed). New files are synced daily around midnight UTC via GitHub Actions.\n\n## What's in Each File\n\nEvery row is a single GDELT event. Columns fall into four groups:\n\n| Group                | Examples                                                                                                               | Count |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| **Event**            | `GLOBALEVENTID`, `SQLDATE`, `EventCode`, `QuadClass`, `GoldsteinScale`, `AvgTone`, `NumMentions`                       | 34    |\n| **Actor geography**  | `Actor1Geo_FullName`, `Actor1Geo_Lat/Long`, `Actor2Geo_*`                                                              | 16    |\n| **Action geography** | `ActionGeo_FullName`, `ActionGeo_CountryCode`, `ActionGeo_Lat/Long`                                                    | 8     |\n| **Geo enrichment**   | `NearestCity`, `CityPopulation`, `DistanceToCity_km`, `CoordQuality` (\u00d73 geo sets)                                     | 12    |\n| **Article**          | `ArticleTitle`, `ArticleContent`, `ArticleAuthor`, `ArticlePublishDate`, `ArticleContentLength`, `ArticleScrapeMethod` | 6     |\n\n**~76 columns total.** Full schema details in the [source repo](https://github.com/tabaqatdev/gdelt-cng).\n\n## Processing Pipeline\n\nRaw GDELT 15-minute dumps go through:\n\n1. **Filter** \u2014 keep only events involving Saudi Arabia\n2. **Clean** \u2014 remove nulls, empty URLs, invalid tone values\n3. **Deduplicate** \u2014 one best record per source URL (scored by data completeness)\n4. **Geo-enrich** \u2014 match coordinates to nearest city using a 33K+ world cities reference via Haversine distance\n5. **Scrape** \u2014 extract article text using Trafilatura \u2192 Newspaper4k \u2192 Playwright fallback chain (up to 500/day)\n\n## Quick Query (DuckDB)\n\n```sql\n-- read a single day\nSELECT * FROM 's3://us-west-2.opendata.source.coop/tabaqat/gdelt-sa/country=SA/year=2026/2026_01_01.parquet' LIMIT 10;\n\n-- count events with articles across all days\nSELECT count(*) AS total,\n       count(ArticleTitle) AS with_articles\nFROM 's3://us-west-2.opendata.source.coop/tabaqat/gdelt-sa/country=SA/**/*.parquet';\n\n-- top mentioned cities\nSELECT NearestCity, count(*) AS n\nFROM 's3://us-west-2.opendata.source.coop/tabaqat/gdelt-sa/country=SA/**/*.parquet'\nWHERE NearestCity IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10;\n```\n\n## License & Attribution\n\nData derived from the [GDELT Project](https://www.gdeltproject.org/). Refer to GDELT's terms of use for redistribution rights. Pipeline source code is MIT licensed.\n",
